{"uid":"79220323bad1c5d","name":"test_real_engine_live_then_container_gone","fullName":"tests.test_cli_steer_list#test_real_engine_live_then_container_gone","historyId":"feaf8e78c1631dc701eadbd2d8e0bf70","time":{"start":1791915885297,"stop":1791915887070,"duration":1773},"description":"The strongest test: steer a REAL engine from the CLI, watch `--list`\n    report it pending and then applied, confirm the hub says the same, then\n    stop the engine and assert `--list` still shows the same entries from the\n    run dir with the snapshot notice.\n\n    task 010 (B.4): STUB_HOLD_FILE/STUB_HOLD_PHASE=\"worker\" holds the first\n    worker iteration open instead of racing a real STUB_SLEEP window to\n    post the steer message while the run is still pending -- that held\n    iteration's own prompt was already built before the steer landed, so\n    it stays pending until we release the hold and a LATER iteration's\n    freshly-built prompt observes and applies it.\n\n    `ralphctl` itself runs in-process (task 003, requirement F) through\n    `_in_process_ralphctl`; the real subprocess boundary that remains is the\n    `ralphd-engine` child `live()` launches, unaffected by this change.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>The strongest test: steer a REAL engine from the CLI, watch <code>--list</code><br />\nreport it pending and then applied, confirm the hub says the same, then<br />\nstop the engine and assert <code>--list</code> still shows the same entries from the<br />\nrun dir with the snapshot notice.</p>\n<pre><code>task 010 (B.4): STUB_HOLD_FILE/STUB_HOLD_PHASE=&quot;worker&quot; holds the first\nworker iteration open instead of racing a real STUB_SLEEP window to\npost the steer message while the run is still pending -- that held\niteration's own prompt was already built before the steer landed, so\nit stays pending until we release the hold and a LATER iteration's\nfreshly-built prompt observes and applies it.\n\n`ralphctl` itself runs in-process (task 003, requirement F) through\n`_in_process_ralphctl`; the real subprocess boundary that remains is the\n`ralphd-engine` child `live()` launches, unaffected by this change.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791915885275,"stop":1791915885275,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791915885275,"stop":1791915885282,"duration":7},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791915885282,"stop":1791915885282,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791915885283,"stop":1791915885289,"duration":6},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_undo_instant_sleep_patches","time":{"start":1791915885289,"stop":1791915885289,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_stub_escalation_backoff_at_class_level","time":{"start":1791915885289,"stop":1791915885289,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_stub_wait_out_backoff_a